        + Triple-DES (`DESede`) ; exige `Permit[Concession.TripleDes]`
  entry .blowfish
    info
        - Blowfish; needs `Permit[Concession.Blowfish]`
        + Blowfish ; exige `Permit[Concession.Blowfish]`
  entry .rc2
