        - RFC 2104 over `HmacMD5`, `HmacSHA1`, `HmacSHA224`, `HmacSHA256`, `HmacSHA384`, `HmacSHA512` or `HMAC-BLAKE3`
        + RFC 2104 sur `HmacMD5`, `HmacSHA1`, `HmacSHA224`, `HmacSHA256`, `HmacSHA384`,
        + `HmacSHA512` ou `HMAC-BLAKE3`
