    info
        - the given `Aes[bits] over mode against padding`, from a mode, a padding, their `Permits` evidence and a `Crypto`
        + le given `Aes[bits] over mode against padding`, à partir d'un mode, d'un
        + remplissage, de leur preuve `Permits` et d'un `Crypto`
