      info
          - HMAC 256/256, identifier 5, for `HmacCipher[Sha2[256]]`
          + HMAC 256/256, identifiant 5, pour `HmacCipher[Sha2[256]]`
    entry .hmacSha384
      info
          - HMAC 384/384, identifier 6, for `HmacCipher[Sha2[384]]`
          + HMAC 384/384, identifiant 6, pour `HmacCipher[Sha2[384]]`
    entry .hmacSha512
      info
          - HMAC 512/512, identifier 7, for `HmacCipher[Sha2[512]]`
          + HMAC 512/512, identifiant 7, pour `HmacCipher[Sha2[512]]`
    entry #Self
      info
          - the cipher type
          + le type de l'algorithme
    entry #algId
